    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27093" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διν-ήεις</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διν-άεις</span></b> , 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διννάεις</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Alc.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			7.2
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, gen. 
			contr.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δινᾶντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					12.78
				</span></i>
			:— <i>whirling, eddying,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ξάνθῳ ἐπὶ δινήεντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.479
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				53.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				46
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rounded,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταλάροιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.55
				</span></i>
			.</div>
